questions.solution:
From conservation of energy
Potential energy $=$ translational kinetic energy + rotational kinetic energy
$$
\begin{array}{r}
m g h=\frac{1}{2} m v^2+\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{2}{5}\right) m R^2 \cdot \frac{v^2}{R^2} \\
\Rightarrow \quad \frac{7}{10} m v^2=m g h \Rightarrow v \geq \sqrt{\frac{10}{7} g h}
\end{array}
$$

